# BaHfO3 MULTIBINIT model-building input template
#
# This file is passed as the first positional argument to the multibinit binary
# by pymultibinit.training.train_multibinit_model(). Adapt the variables below
# to the exact training syntax supported by your ABINIT/MULTIBINIT build.
#
# Resolved input paths are also exposed to the binary as environment variables:
#   PYMULTIBINIT_DDB
#   PYMULTIBINIT_HIST
#   PYMULTIBINIT_OUTPUT_DIR
#
# The example DDB is examples/BaHfO3_example/BaHfO3_DDB. The HIST.nc file must
# be generated separately from an ABINIT trajectory or from atomchain.

# Harmonic/response input metadata
ngqpt 4 4 4
dipdip 1
ncell 2 2 2

# Training-control placeholders. Replace with the exact keywords required by
# the multibinit executable used for model building.
dynamics 0
ntime 0
